          "description": "\nCreate an experience and pointage system, The rewards system that provides 25 points and 25 experience for a block of 25 minutes of work. You can create your own rewards like \"3D printer allowance\" for 2000 pts meaning that u can spend 2000 pts to allow yourself to buy a 3d printer. and like so. The experience system is for unlocking more features on the application itself (will be used later) but for now have a screen in the analytics systems for viewing how many points and experience, management of rewards and and toggle distoggle features of the application that can only be toggled after certain experience points",
